            "content": "<p>While we work closely with Australia Post to ensure timely delivery, delays may occur due to:</p><p><br/>• Courier network congestion<br/>• Weather conditions<br/>• Public holidays<br/>• Peak shopping periods</p><p><br/>Such delays are outside of our control and do not qualify for refunds.</p>"
